  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - 4.There should be no visible emission of particulates from any part of the building used for shot blasting.",
    "Condition : 5 - 5.There should be no deposition of particulates at or beyond the site boundary.",
    "Condition : 6 - The shot blasting machine, airwash separator and screw conveyor should only be used when the shutter door to the building is closed.",
    "Condition : 7 - All dust filters are to be used in accordance with the manufacturer's and/or the installer's requirements and to be changed in accordance with the manufacturer's/installer's specification.",
    "Condition : 8 - 8.There should be no increase in the background noise level, when the noise from the use of the proposed development is measured at the boundary with the Duke of Northumberland's River, to the south of the site.\r\n\r\n"
  ],
